  <item><title>usefulwaves 0.0.10</title><description>Screenshot dictation now delivers images to Slack for Mac in capture order and lets you recover interrupted pastes. In Herdr, press Command-V to paste the screenshot files, then choose Copy Text to paste the transcript. Suggested-work previews and their editors now resize with the capture pane.</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 12:13:43 +0100</pubDate><sparkle:version>10</sparkle:version><sparkle:shortVersionString>0.0.10</sparkle:shortVersionString><sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion><enclosure url="https://github.com/uid4oe/usefulwaves-releases/releases/download/v0.0.10/usefulwaves-0.0.10.dmg" length="5815767" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="KhsUiYAvwoeIO/4iJohMH/gDHL9mbkHw1Wuy4ps+XZHqmwDVQDVhNdYeZiclg4qctOW3ozTMGjzpeD4HKG9LCQ=="></enclosure></item><item><title>usefulwaves 0.0.11</title><description>Click links in embedded capture sessions to open them in their default macOS app. Closed sessions now show their status, an Open button, and a three-dot menu beside the capture title in notes, meetings, and QA reviews.</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 13:43:12 +0100</pubDate><sparkle:version>11</sparkle:version><sparkle:shortVersionString>0.0.11</sparkle:shortVersionString><sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion><enclosure url="https://github.com/uid4oe/usefulwaves-releases/releases/download/v0.0.11/usefulwaves-0.0.11.dmg" length="5836283" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="ScoTwhoHd6I7S7elvK5PNV1ZWlwD2hwFLUhyN1mJZPh+LwRZkauxTSPAd8REhhYDSlAxQtVlu8au8HBRqSNSAw=="></enclosure></item></channel>
